  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      {{ site.title }} is a reading companion for board game rules. Each game has
      a set of authored pages — a rulebook, a summary, a glossary and a book
      index — cross-linked to each other and searchable within that game.
    </p>

    <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every section has a permanent anchor, so a link you save keeps working.</li>
      <li>Search on a game’s page only ever returns results from that game.</li>
      <li>Bookmarks are stored in your browser. No account, no server, no tracking.</li>
      <li>Every page is laid out for print as carefully as it is for screen.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="content">Content</h2>
    <p>
      Rules text belongs to its publishers and designers and is reproduced here
      as a reading aid. Corrections are welcome via
      <a href="{{ site.repo }}">the repository</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
